#: src/ui/bk-settings.c:648
msgid "Touchpad speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/ui/bk-settings.c:649
msgid ""
"<b>Automatic</b>\n"
"• Only the keyboard open: <b>touchpad</b>. Drag a finger to move the "
"pointer; a quick tap is a left click wherever the pointer is; hold the "
"finger still for half a second and drag to drag with the button pressed.\n"
"• Keyboard and on-screen gamepad together: <b>direct touch</b>. The pointer "
"goes to the finger and left-clicks there; dragging drags.\n"
"• In both: with one finger on the screen, a tap with another finger is a "
"<b>right click</b>; two fingers together scroll the page.\n"
"• Only the on-screen gamepad open: tapping outside the controls does nothing "
"(in the middle of a game, a stray click gets in the way).\n"
"• Keyboard and gamepad hidden, in the <b>Also the mouse with both hidden</b> "
"mode (Big Remote Play uses it on wlmaker, which ignores the Sunshine touch): "
"<b>touchpad</b> on the whole screen."
msgstr ""

#: src/ui/bk-settings.c:662
msgid ""
"<small>The keyboard opens on the streamed monitor while a phone is "
"connected. The monitor is the one of the on-screen gamepad (Big Remote Play "
"chooses it; on the command line, <tt>--output</tt>).</small>"
msgstr ""

